# T12: the performance budget on Ransom, the largest shipped mission
# (RWSMAN_CORPUS=<unpacked game>, Release builds only). With every marker
# layer shown and the whole map in view, the median CPU frame time, the
# Outliner's rows and the Problems list stay within their budgets, so the
# aggregation added for the redesign (E7, B2) cannot slow the editor down
# unnoticed.
require RWSMAN_CORPUS
require-release
open $RWSMAN_CORPUS/Ransom/Maps/FR01/Ransom.scn
wait idle
command view.markers_preset.all
command view.frame_all
command view.markers_labels
command view.panel.problems
command view.panel.outliner
wait frames 150
# Measured 1.2, 0.14 and 0.02 ms on the reference machine (2026-09-26): the
# budgets leave room for slower machines and catch a tenfold regression.
expect-at-most perf.frame_ms 16
expect-at-most perf.outliner_ms 4
expect-at-most perf.problems_ms 20
